		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030070"},
		line=1172,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Even as I silently close the door behind me with a click, Empress Hisui doesn't look up from her desk.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Though her pen remains motionless, she continues staring intently at her open diary.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your Majesty?”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"She finally looks up once I call out to her a second time.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ah! Elsa-sama?!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Empress Hisui slams her diary shut in a panic.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Please forgive my intrusion. I called out to you several times without any response, so I took the liberty of entering on my own.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Pay it no mind. In fact, I ought to apologize myself for being so absent-minded.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your complexion has quite the pallor... Might anything have happened at school today?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Say... showing an unsightly side of yourself to someone you care about?”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Wh-What are you suggesting?!”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"At once, the blood rushes to Empress Hisui's face.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Her expression tells me I'm right on the money.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh dear. I only meant it as a joke...”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...But it looks like you just might be in quite a bit of trouble.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ah, umm... I-I mean...”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Empress Hisui rushes to compose herself, but it's way too late for that.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"It looks like I was right to ask that leading question.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"As she fumbles for an answer, I take advantage of her distraction to snatch her diary from the table.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ahh!”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"She immediately tries to grab at it, but I easily pin her dainty arms down with one hand while flipping through the diary with the other.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“'As you held me in your arms in that classroom, your Kanami positively ascended to the divine plains.'”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“'For a few blissful moments, I was once again transported back to those halcyon days when I was still your Tokita\nKanami.'”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Er, um, umm...! Th-That's...!”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Her wrists falling limp in dismay, Empress Hisui all but confirms that she is the author of this diary─",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Of these heartfelt confessions by one Tokita Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tokita Kanami, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"I've had my suspicions about Empress Hisui's identity since early spring.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"It started when I noticed her uncanny experience with first aid, and grew stronger when she admitted to having bought the netsuke while “out shopping.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Tokita-kun's surprising interest in the netsuke all but confirmed my suspicions.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"And just as it happens, while I was monitoring her behavior at school, I noticed her sneaking into that empty classroom today.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Empress Hisui, Tokita-kun, and Miyaguni-san spent nearly fifteen minutes in there before coming out.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"It's obvious they were looking for a private place to meet without being overheard.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"With that, I felt like I finally had enough to pin her down, and my intuitions certainly weren't wrong.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Care to explain, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Kanami-san?",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Empress Hisui's eyes furtively dart around as the blood slowly drains from her face.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"I grin to myself, feeling very much like the wicked snake glaring at the helpless frog from Imperial folk tales.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Save for her faint trembling, she doesn't move a muscle, but I can tell that her heart is pounding wildly inside her chest.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...As you have surmised, I am not truly of the Imperial Family.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am naught but a false Empress of Okonogi's creation.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“So you were deceiving me this whole time?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I'm... terribly sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I trusted you enough to bet everything on this plot, but it seems like you don't feel the same way.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“That's not true!”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am still determined to strike Okonogi down!”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It's just that things have taken a turn for the unexpected...”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Really now? I wonder...”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It's the truth!”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"She emphatically declares, her eyes burning with a steadfast conviction.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"It really doesn't look like she's lying, but it's hard to trust her all the same.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Well, I suppose it's fitting, given my own deception with Operation Bellflower.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Trust never needed to be part of the equation in the first place.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"I just need to stay in the driver's seat and make sure she\ndoesn't turn against me.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'd love nothing more than to trust you again, but you can probably understand why I'm rather hesitant...”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"I clasp Empress Hisui on the shoulders and bring my face level with hers.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“For the sake of our continued cooperation, won't you tell me everything from the beginning?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Just who are you? Why are you playing the part of the Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"With faltering words, Empress Hisui tells me of her past and how she came to be the Empress.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"It seems that Empress Hisui... Tokita Kanami is just a powerless girl being used by Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Who else knows who you really are?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Besides Okonogi... I believe it would only be Hotori-chan and Onii-sama, as well as Miyaguni-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Though I do not know if Okonogi has told anyone else.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Given how secretive that man is, that list of people must be very small indeed.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"...Is the governor-general even aware of this?",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"If not, then does that mean he is carrying out this entire deception in complete secret?",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"But if so, what purpose could he have had to install a false Empress on the throne?",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"The first possibility that comes to mind is that he wanted a smooth way to seize power.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"It'd be much easier to co-opt the political institution that's existed for over two thousand years than to build his power base from scratch.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"The Empress is not just the head of state, but an important figure of religious worship.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Abolishing the Imperial system would certainly carry its fair share of risks.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What do you know about the real Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I can at least confirm that she is alive.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“She's alive?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"That's awfully unexpected.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"I'd thought that the Imperial bloodline was extinguished for good.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I once overheard her talking to Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I was not able to catch a glimpse of her, so all that I know is that she is a woman.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But I do believe that she is quite young.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What were they talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Her Highness was cursing Okonogi as a traitor who sold out his own country.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“And she swore on her own life to strike him down.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"She declared war straight to his face, huh?",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“So, did he lock up the real princess after that?”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Nothing happened on that occasion.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I do not know what might have happened afterwards, however.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Thinking about it realistically, Okonogi would never let the real princess run at large.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"He must have surely dealt with her in secret.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Even if he didn't kill her, he should at least be monitoring her every action.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, do you intend to search for the real Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As if.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“In fact, I sincerely hope that Okonogi did his job for once and took care of her already.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“What nerve to say such a thing...”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Think carefully now.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Operation Bellflower only succeeds if you stay as Empress Hisui.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“There only needs to be one person to sit on the throne. And that person is you.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"I lean forward, peering into her eyes from up close.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You are the person that the Imperial people look up to.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" continue serving as their Empress. Are we clear?”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I understand.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Empress Hisui shows me an obedient nod.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“In exchange, could I ask you to please keep the matter regarding Onii-sama a secret?”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I fear what may happen if Okonogi were to ever find out...”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"She's implying that Okonogi wouldn't hesitate to silence anyone who is discovered to know of Empress Hisui's true identity.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"But is it even possible that Okonogi truly doesn't know about Tokita-kun's existence?",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"The fact that Empress Hisui might have surviving relatives\nshould've been the first potential complication that comes to mind.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
{"font", size=51},
"It might've been possible for Tokita-kun to slip under Okonogi's radar if he were hiding his identity, but he's leading a regular life and working at a flower shop under his real name.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"There's no way that he hasn't already been caught up by\nOkonogi's intelligence network.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Does that mean Okonogi is aware but just choosing to not take any action?",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"If so, then to what end?",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"...It doesn't add up.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"─The real Empress could still be alive, and her whereabouts are unknown.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"─Meanwhile, he's allowing the false Empress's family members to roam freely.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"─On top of all that, he's even allowing her to attend the same school as Tokita-kun.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"He's being far too complacent... Or could he have some secret agenda?",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Keep Tokita-kun a secret? I think I just might...”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...Depending, of course, on Your Majesty's cooperation.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"I seize Empress Hisui by the chin and turn her to face me head-on.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You've already betrayed me once.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Think carefully before you do anything stupid.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I have no words.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I want to be able to trust you to the very end.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes. I swear to live up to your expectations.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"I need to keep Empress Hisui in the palm of my hand in order to wipe out the warriors.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"But with how naïve she is, gently piling on the guilt for lying to me should be enough to keep her in line.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"The next step is to deal with the warriors.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Incidentally, just how long has Tokita-kun known who you really are?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama mentioned that he first started having doubts when we met in the student council office.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Did he say anything about Operation Bellflower to you?”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Say, for example, that he can no longer offer his cooperation given that the Empress is an impostor?”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“No, nothing in particular.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Empress Hisui replies with a slight hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"My long years of military experience immediately sound the alarm.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Tokita-kun just might have hinted at the warriors' intent to abandon the operation.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"From their perspective, they've suddenly discovered that Empress Hisui, the object of their fealty, is an impostor.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"By all rights, this ought to have been a massive shock.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"I'll need to watch their movements especially carefully from now on.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"...All my plans will fall apart unless they cooperate and take down Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"As I blink my eyes open, the first thing I see is a familiar, dim ceiling.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"...I'm in my own room.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A dream, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Its contents have vanished with my waking, but my heart is still racing all the same.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Yet, I don't think it was an unpleasant dream.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"I check the time to find that it is only four of the clock.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"I still have a good deal of time before Kotone comes to inspect my physical condition.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"I lie back down and close my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"─Back to sleep, perchance to continue my dream...",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"My ears fill with cries of battle, the resounding sound of steel against steel, the screams and wails of the fallen─",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Amid this crashing symphony of the battlefield, I dance my solitary dance.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"And cut down the encroaching enemy.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Another.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"And another.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"And another. And another.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"And another. And another. And another.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"I think of nothing but cutting down the enemy.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Once all the enemies have been felled, I proceed unto the next battlefield.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Another.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"And another.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"And another. And another.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"And another. And another. And another.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"There is no end to the battlefield nor the enemies upon it.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"They surge before me as an unceasing tide.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"And in the midst of this billowing storm, I tirelessly swing my blade.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"As if ordained by divine providence, I indefatigably render these living beings into voiceless remains.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Endless hell though this scenery may be, I feel nary a ripple in my heart.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"My mind is free of all obstructive thoughts.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"My soul is an unblemished, endlessly pure expanse.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Such is the ideal form of a warrior─",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Within this dream, I managed to attain the realm of “heart and blade in concord.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Heheh, what a most fitting dream for a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"When Kotone arrives to give me a checkup, I recount to her the dream I just saw.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Though I must confess that it sounds rather frightening, from my own point of view.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What sort of warrior could fear the battlefield?”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Though it was but a dream, I still feel fortunate indeed that I was able to brush against the ideal of “heart and blade in concord.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Among warriors, you often hear stories about revelations from dreams giving birth to dramatic improvements in bladesmanship.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"I'll need to redouble my efforts in training moving forward.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, is there anything wrong with my body?”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Physically, I found absolutely no problems whatsoever.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“There were no abnormalities with your spellcrest, either.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's good to hear.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"I busy myself with putting my shirt back on.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Out of the corner of my eye, I notice Kotone crossing her arms sullenly.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Even so... this is most mysterious indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In truth, I feel as though there is still much I have yet to understand...”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You mean my healing abilities?”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Kotone nods, a pensive expression on her face.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I noticed this back when you snuck into the Imperial Palace as well, but your healing abilities are truly abnormal.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“There is surely some strange power at work here, but...”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"She turns her head to and fro with unease.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm trying not to worry about it since it's not hurting me, but I agree that it's pretty unsettling.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Besides, you haven't been able to find any leads on my spellcrest, have you?”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am afraid not.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I did some research in the temple archives, but I was not able to find any references to it.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The shape of a spellcrest is predetermined to a certain extent based on one's bloodline.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“For example, a single glance at Hotori-sama's crest would reveal that she is of House Inou, even if you were not aware that it is her crest you are examining.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In other words, even the bloodline that I come from is a total mystery?”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That is indeed the case.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But put another way, if we are ever able to figure that out, it might end up revealing a lot about me.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"Hotori says she doesn't know anything about my past before I was adopted by House Tokita.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"But it's possible that Kanami might have some idea.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"She is, after all, the last surviving member of my family.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll be sure to ask Kanami the next time I see her.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Kanami-sama? Whoever might that be?”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, did I forget to tell you?”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As it turns out...”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whaaaaaaaaaat?!”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"On the days I have checkups, Akari, Kotone, and I all go to school together.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Akari is waiting as usual right outside of Koujiya Flowers.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Was it just me, or was Kotone screaming her head off a few minutes ago?”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I apologize. I was given certain cause to...”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Was it Soujin's fault?”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, yes... But it is not a matter to be discussed in public...”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Souuujiiinnn?”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All I did was tell her about Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, yeah... Guess we really can't talk about that here, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"She cheerfully claps her hands together, forgetting all about her indignation.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Oh my, is Kotone-san joining you this morning?”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"The manager pokes his head out from inside the store.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Good morning to you, Mr. Manager.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“It's getting hot lately, so take care to not get heatstroke.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“You ladies ought to be especially careful.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Take care of yourself too, Manager.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You look like you'll melt away if you stay under the sun for too long.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Hahaha, folks sure do worry about me quite a bit.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“But I don't think melting away would be such a bad way to go out, if I do say so myself.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"It's hard to think of anyone that seems less suited to sunlight than the manager.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
{"font", size=51},
"The sight of him stepping out of the store to brave the midsummer rays tugs at the heartstrings as much as the sight of a sea turtle floundering helplessly on a scorching hot beach.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"Well, looks can be deceiving, I suppose. The manager regularly goes swimming at the beach without a care in the world.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah, Manager, I had a question for you.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Absolutely! Ask away.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"I want to hear his account of how he came to find me after I was wounded during the war.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"I now have a decent idea of what I was doing after piecing together what I heard from Akari, Hotori, and Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"I was out on a training exercise with Hotori and the rest of the Myougi Squad on the day it all started.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"Sometime around midday, the Barrier was destroyed without warning, and the Republic commenced its bombing of the Warrior District.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"I immediately split off from the Myougi Squad and rescued Akari at the Imperial Tomb.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"It's likely that before I lost my memories, I had known that Akari was the Imperial Princess.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"After I rescued Akari, I was locked in a duel with someone, according to Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"Right after that, she and I were both caught up in a mysterious explosion.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"─That's about all I know so far.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You found me some time after the war ended, right? Where was that?”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Where's this coming from, all of a sudden?”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I have my reasons.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Hmm, I see...”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"The manager crosses his arms with a strangely happy look on his face.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I picked you up in Shirogane District.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“It was right after the peace treaty was signed, so it\nmust've been a week or so after the war first began.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Apparently there was some big explosion or other, and Shirogane District was one big pile of rubble.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“And I happened to find you right there, underneath that rubble.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you know what kind of explosion it was?”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I wasn't there myself, but I heard that a bright light descended down from the sky.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“It must have been some kind of Republican bomb.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"It seems like I really was caught up in an explosion, just as Kanami said.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"So, after saving Akari at the Imperial Tomb, I must have moved to Shirogane District before getting caught up in a duel.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"Following that, a bomb fell nearby, and I was buried under the rubble.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"Which means that the only remaining unknowns are who I was fighting and whether they also managed to survive.",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you know how many victims there were in that explosion?”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Quite a few residents lost their lives, so I hear.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“After all, nearly two blocks were completely leveled.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hard to believe you managed to make it out in one piece.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You must've been trapped under the rubble for like, an entire week, right?”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I suppose he must have been.”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“If he managed to survive for that long without any food or water, he must have the soul of a cactus.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ahaha! Now that you mention, Soujin totally does have a real cactusy vibe about him.”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...How so?”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“See? It's exactly that sorta prickliness I'm talking about!”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"Akari delicately pokes me with her finger, as though she's really touching a cactus spine.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"But joking aside, it must have been my healing powers that kept me alive for an entire week.",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How were his injuries when you first found him?”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“He was covered from head to toe, but only with minor scratches.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“And so, I carried him back home and Healed him with magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“He opened his eyes... three days later, was it?”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"I still vaguely remember that time.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"I didn't even remember my own name, and yet the manager was very kind to me.",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I could tell he was a warrior based on his build, so I called the Inous right away.”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“And wouldn't you know it, Hotori-san came running over before I could even hang up the phone!”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yes, I remember everything after that clearly.”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Well, that's all I have to say... Was it of any help?”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Very much so. I really appreciate it.”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Then I'll be getting back to work now.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“If you need anything else, please don't hesitate to ask!”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you very much.”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Take care, now.”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"The manager picks up his shears and returns to his work pruning the newly arrived stock.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			{
"A rhythmic, metallic snipping sound begins ringing out from the store.",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			{
"It's a sound I've grown very fond of.",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"For someone with no past like me, it's the sound of home.",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The manager has a most uncanny charm about him. It is as though he might drift away on the wind at any moment.”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even so, he's always looked out for me. He's a wonderful man.”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“His past is a total mystery, though.”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There sure aren't many florists out there who are also magickers, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do you know if he used to be part of the priesthood?”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			{
"She turns to ask Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That would not appear to be the case.”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If he were formerly of the priesthood, the head office at Iseya would have records of his ordainment.”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then is he self-taught? Or did he have a teacher?”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“He once told me that he did indeed have a teacher.”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But it is customary to refrain from passing on magicks to the general public.”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“He must have been exceptionally close to someone of the priesthood, or there might have been some extraordinary circumstances involved...”",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"Kotone murmurs to herself as she restlessly cocks her head from side to side.",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He might very well have some shady past dealings...”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The manager is my savior. I don't want to start suspecting him.”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Isn't it better to be safe than sorry? Especially now of all times.”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			{
"She means to say that the manager knows far too much about us.",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"If he were to ever turn against us, the consequences might end up being fatal.",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
"But even so, it goes against all my beliefs to suspect someone that I've already placed my faith in.",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I believe in him.”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But just in case, I'll tell the Blades' spies to keep a closer eye on him.”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
